# Keep the build context small and, critically, keep real secrets out of the image.
# A stray `.env` here would be baked into a layer and recoverable from the image history.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
private-uploads

.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.log
npm-debug.log*
